# Service Management

## Start a service

```bash
ansible all -b -m service -a "name=nginx state=started"
```

## Stop a service

```bash
ansible all -b -m service -a "name=nginx state=stopped"
```

## Restart a service

```bash
ansible all -b -m service -a "name=nginx state=restarted"
```

## Reload a service

```bash
ansible all -b -m service -a "name=nginx state=reloaded"
```

## Enable a service

```bash
ansible all -b -m service -a "name=nginx enabled=yes"
```

## Disable a service

```bash
ansible all -b -m service -a "name=nginx enabled=no"
```

## Ensure a service is running

```bash
ansible all -b -m service -a "name=docker state=started enabled=yes"
```

## Restart Docker

```bash
ansible all -b -m service -a "name=docker state=restarted"
```

## Check service status

```bash
ansible all -m shell -a "systemctl status nginx"
```

## List all running services

```bash
ansible all -m shell -a "systemctl list-units --type=service"
```
